# CR 702.28: Shadow. Dauthi Slayer's K:Shadow synthesizes Mode$ CantBlockBy |
# ValidBlocker$ Creature.withoutShadow (CardFactoryUtil.java:3994-4002), so the
# AI's Grizzly Bears, which has no shadow, cannot block it and the declare
# blockers declaration is empty (a block queued as 2=1 would be illegal). The
# Slayer's 2 damage reaches the AI.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
